# Required application secrets. Generate unique values for each environment.
SECRET_KEY=replace-with-a-random-secret-at-least-32-characters-long
ADMIN_USERNAME=admin
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-strong-password

# Optional integrations.
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
HF_TOKEN=
HF_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3-32B
HF_RAG_MODEL=meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct

# Optional runtime settings.
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./resume_analyzer.db
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60
CORS_ORIGINS=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# UPLOAD_DIR is managed relative to the project directory by default.

# Never commit .env or real credentials.

---

### Local test-only values
The test suite sets isolated credentials and a temporary SQLite database before importing the application. Do not copy those values into a deployed environment.

---

### Configuration contract
`SECRET_KEY`, `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_EMAIL`, and `ADMIN_PASSWORD` are required at startup. The application fails fast when they are missing; it does not generate a new signing key or create a fixed public administrator password.
